hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"27914","Abu Bakr al-Hanafi narrated to us, he said: Usamah ibn Zayd narrated to us, from Amr ibn Shuayb, from Umm Kurz al-Khuzaiyyah, she said: The Prophet, peace and blessings of Allah be upon him, was brought a boy, and he urinated upon him, so he ordered regarding it and it was sprinkled. And a girl was brought, and she urinated upon him, so he ordered regarding it and it was washed."
